# Files that JHipster generates and the registry has changed. When JHipster runs in this directory it leaves
# them alone, so compare them with the new output by hand. The steps in DEVELOPMENT.md avoid that: they
# regenerate on the jhipster_upgrade branch and merge it, which also covers the files that are not listed here
# because they should always be merged: pom.xml, package.json and the files in src/main/resources/config.
#
# Keep this list to single files, so that new files JHipster adds next to them are not skipped.

.devcontainer/Dockerfile
README.md
proxy.config.mjs
sonar-project.properties
src/main/docker/app.yml
src/main/docker/grafana/provisioning/dashboards/JVM.json
src/main/docker/jhipster-control-center.yml
src/main/docker/jib/entrypoint.sh
src/main/docker/monitoring.yml
src/main/docker/sonar.yml
src/main/docker/zipkin.yml
